WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.753
An open-source Figma

00:00:01.565 --> 00:00:02.861
alternative that writes

00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:03.416
real code

00:00:03.942 --> 00:00:05.262
Onlook from Y

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:06.288
Combinator's Winter

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.515
2025 batch

00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:08.423
is a free

00:00:08.612 --> 00:00:09.696
local-first editor

00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:10.923
where designers craft

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:12.279
experiences in code

00:00:12.814 --> 00:00:13.580
You see your

00:00:13.392 --> 00:00:14.288
real app running

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:14.712
live on a

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:15.290
canvas

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:16.387
shape it visually

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:16.929
and let your

00:00:16.741 --> 00:00:17.672
own agent write

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.156
the code

00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:19.131
They don't ship

00:00:18.943 --> 00:00:19.650
a model

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:21.329
It pitches itself

00:00:21.176 --> 00:00:22.119
as an open-source

00:00:21.931 --> 00:00:23.428
alternative to Figma

00:00:23.511 --> 00:00:24.313
V0

00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:25.669
Replit Agent and

00:00:25.481 --> 00:00:26.695
Webflow under the

00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:28.699
Apache 2.0 license

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:30.252
Full story on

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:30.959
the dashboard
